:: day2_kitchen [nobr]
<<locationImage "kitchens" "Palace Kitchens">>
<h2>🍞 Palace Kitchens</h2>
<p>Heat, steam, three hearths blazing. The smell of fresh bread and rosemary. The kitchen is running at normal tempo   not crisis, not siege. Normal.</p>

<<completeObjective "explore_palace">>

<<if not $d2f_npc_marta>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "marta" "Marta">>
  <h4>👩‍🍳 Head Cook Marta</h4>
  <p>She sees you in the doorway. For one fraction of a second her face does something. Then: a pointed finger. The stool.</p>
  [[Sit → |day2_npc_marta]]
</div>
<<else>>
  <p class="empty-note">The kitchen hums on. Marta is back to commanding her domain. No one else needs your attention.</p>
<</if>>

